      "packageName": "com.pulse.music",
      "name": "Pulse Music",
      "summary": "Modern music player with real-time lyrics & seamless continuous playback",
      "description": "Experience music like never before with Pulse Music.\n\nFeatures:\n* Ad-free streaming in background\n* Continuous playback engine with zero freezes and rapid skipping\n* Real-time synchronized lyrics (Musixmatch, LRCLIB, Spotify)\n* Seamless background Gemini AI translation\n* Offline caching and downloaded songs support\n* Equalizer, spatial audio, and sound enhancements\n* Home, Charts, Moods & Genres with high-speed browsing\n* SponsorBlock & Return YouTube Dislike integration\n* In-app OTA updates and trending music notifications\n* Sleep timer and Android Auto support",
      "icon": "icon.png",
